  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "17.3.1-beta.2:\n      - Page Audit & Content Exclusions: Dedicated 'Page Audit' navigation and 'Excluded Content' management for pages and document types.\n      - Site Configuration Lock: Enforce read-only indicators and system policy for site configuration exclusions.\n      - Whitelist Overrides: Manually include individual pages as exceptions under bulk-excluded Document Types.\n      - Element Type Filtering: Cleanly filter out Element Types from document type selectors.\n      - Direct Document Links: One-click navigation to Umbraco Content Workspace for every page in the audit table.\n      - Multi-Umbraco Support: Dual-targeted package dependencies for Umbraco 17 ([17.5.3, 18.0.0)) and Umbraco 18 ([18.0.2, 19.0.0)).\n\n      17.3.1-beta.1:\n      - Global Schema Dashboard: Full backoffice management for organization identity, founders, services catalog (hasOfferCatalog), memberships (memberOf), slogan, and physical locations.\n      - Unified Site-Level Schema: Automatic emission of Schema.org WebSite, Organization, ProfessionalService, and Breadcrumbs without consuming InMotion AI credits.\n      - LLMs.txt & Markdown Emission Engine: Serving /llms.txt, /llms-full.txt, and Markdown page rendering with alternate link headers.\n      - Resilient Crawler: Automatic redirect following (up to 10 hops) and loopback SSL support for local development.\n\n      18.3.0:\n      - Automatic author entity extraction from Umbraco document pickers (Person, Author, TeamMember).\n      - Companion person field resolution (role/jobTitle, bio/description, photo media URLs).\n      - Hybrid context envelope for accurate Schema.org JSON-LD generation.\n      - Workspace view tab repositioning next to Info tab.\n      - Universal date signals support.",
